patch","merged_at":"2026-08-27T01:39:50Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThis fixes a runtime error reported by CI:\r\n\r\n```\r\neditor/docks/editor_dock_manager.cpp:380:101: runtime error: load of value 3200171710, which is not a valid value for type 'DockLayout'\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes the problem by initializing the field.\r\n\r\nI initialized it to `DOCK_LAYOUT_VERTICAL` because:\r\n\r\n1. This is the default value used by `DockTabContainer`.\r\n2. This is one of the two values in the neighboring `available_layouts`.\r\n\r\nEDIT: Changed to `DOCK_LAYOUT_NONE` per @KoBeWi's suggestion.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI used AI to search for fixes to runtime errors on the godot-dimensions CI, and I am verifying each one as I submit upstream. This one is... quite trivial, but I still checked anyway.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122831/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.g